+**Verdict: funnel speed mandate PASSES warm-path on both hosts (156/112 ms FCP, first warm-path evidence). Signup works end-to-end but the register→login roundtrip is broken server-side (new CRITICAL datum sharpening F-1: correct client origin, server rejects valid credentials, second-visit lockout). 320 px class PASSES page-level with F-4 confirmed to worsen at the small end. Post-#1782 deploy skew discovered: primary Pages stale at SW v4 (empty runtime cache), mirror Vercel verified fixed (6 cached assets) — ops lane, re-deploy Pages. Zero duplicates.**
